<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for Community building</h2>
<p>Before launching community building automation, prove every app in the stack logs email and SMS consent auditably, with purchase events cutting promotional follow-up the moment checkout completes. In community building, mistimed sends after purchases, refunds, or support cases destroy channel value quicker than any creative miss.</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8"><table>
<thead><tr><th>Audience state</th><th>Required handling</th><th>Why it matters</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>No documented consent</td><td>No community building promos without proof; transactional messages only</td><td>Consent evidence underwrites all community building sending</td></tr>
<tr><td>Consented, never purchased</td><td>Open community building with guidance and proof, not discounts</td><td>Early community building discounts train deal-waiting</td></tr>
<tr><td>Active cart, no checkout</td><td>Community Building reminder with product context; discount withheld</td><td>Protects community building profit when purchase intent is hottest</td></tr>
<tr><td>Purchased recently</td><td>Pause community building promos; switch to post-purchase teaching</td><td>Post-checkout community building pitches trigger regret and opt-outs</td></tr>
<tr><td>Refund or return open</td><td>Community Building selling waits for case resolution</td><td>Community Building tolerance collapses mid-dispute</td></tr>
<tr><td>Repeated non-engagement</td><td>Prune unengaged community building profiles early</td><td>Keeps community building placement high via list hygiene</td></tr>
<tr><td>SMS consent present</td><td>Cap community building SMS cadence within legal quiet windows</td><td>Community Building SMS risk exceeds email per complaint</td></tr>
<tr><td>Wholesale or B2B account</td><td>Send community building B2B accounts down their own track</td><td>B2B community building mis-sends risk contract breach</td></tr>
<tr><td>Free or disposable email domain</td><td>Screen community building free/disposable emails before flows</td><td>Low-grade community building signups drag deliverability</td></tr>
<tr><td>Staff and test accounts</td><td>Community Building internal accounts never enter production</td><td>QA community building sends distort real performance</td></tr>
<tr><td>Competitor or researcher signals</td><td>Community Building researcher signups follow standard consent</td><td>Manual community building exceptions rot the audit trail</td></tr>
<tr><td>Legacy list without timestamps</td><td>Legacy community building contacts re-opt before journeys</td><td>Community Building compliance demands re-permission</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
